---
import SectionHead from '@components/SectionHead.astro';

const PILLARS = [
    { english: 'Genomics', number: '01', title: '基因' },
    { english: 'Cell Therapy', number: '02', title: '细胞' },
    { english: 'Immunology', number: '03', title: '免疫干预' },
    { english: 'Global Care', number: '04', title: '海外医疗' },
];
---

<section
    class="services-premium-intro section"
    aria-labelledby="services-premium-intro-title"
>
    <div class="shell">
        <div class="services-premium-intro__head">
            <div data-scroll="left">
                <SectionHead
                    eyebrow="Bespoke Health"
                    headingId="services-premium-intro-title"
                >
                    高端定制健管服务
                    <Fragment slot="text">
                        <p>惠泽协助尊贵的客户个性化定制基因、细胞、免疫干预和海外医疗服务。</p>
                    </Fragment>
                </SectionHead>
            </div>
            <div
                class="prose services-premium-intro__copy"
                data-scroll="right"
            >
                <p>从古至今，健康长寿都是人类追求的目标。然而，受水、空气、土壤污染和不良生活方式的影响，人类面临前所未有的现代疾病。随着生物技术的不断发展，人类已经可以从基因、细胞和免疫等层面，对疾病进行个性化的干预。</p>
                <p>大部分先进的生物技术来自发达国家和地区。在个性化医疗服务方面，我们协助客户及时了解国内外的技术和产品，对接相应的团队，提供一对一的全流程服务。</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <ul
            class="services-premium-intro__pillars"
            data-scroll="scale"
            data-scroll-stagger
        >
            {PILLARS.map(pillar => (
                <li class="card services-premium-intro__pillar">
                    <span class="numeral">{pillar.number}</span>
                    <h3>{pillar.title}</h3>
                    <span
                        class="label label--gold"
                        lang="en"
                    >
                        {pillar.english}
                    </span>
                </li>
            ))}
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .services-premium-intro__copy {
        padding-top: 3rem;
    }

    .services-premium-intro__head {
        display: grid;
        gap: clamp(2rem, calc(1.33rem + 3.33vw), 4rem);
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr);
    }

    .services-premium-intro__pillar {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        height: 100%;
    }

    .services-premium-intro__pillar h3 {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .services-premium-intro__pillars {
        display: grid;
        gap: clamp(1.25rem, calc(1.04rem + 1.04vw), 1.875rem);
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
        list-style: none;
        margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, calc(1.83rem + 3.33vw), 4.5rem);
        padding: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .services-premium-intro__copy {
            padding-top: 0;
        }

        .services-premium-intro__head {
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        }

        .services-premium-intro__pillars {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(11rem, 1fr));
        }
    }

</style>
